# Full-resolution source headshots. scripts/import-headshots.mjs turns these into the
# optimized website/public/team/{slug}.{avif,webp,jpg} files that pages actually use, and
# that script runs locally, never on Vercel. Everything under website/public/ is published
# verbatim, so leaving these in the deploy pushed 24MB of unreferenced full-res staff photos
# to the public internet on every build. Kept in git (the team edits them); just not shipped.
website/public/images/headshots/
